Comparison is against the **entire** accepted 1,575-module audit, not merely an inherited submodule subset. There are 40 globally new names, of which 27 are theorem rows. All are attributed to the three new modules, and all authored top-level declaration heads are present. There are 5,011 shared names: 5,007 records are literally identical and four have exactly these qualified differences.

